Dialogue: 3,0:20:42.20,0:20:46.75,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}たとえば　不安な夜でも
Dialogue: 3,0:20:47.62,0:20:52.67,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}心に明かりを灯せたら
Dialogue: 3,0:20:53.00,0:20:57.01,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}弊えた希望も生きてると
Dialogue: 3,0:20:57.01,0:21:02.14,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}静かに　教えてくれたね
Dialogue: 3,0:21:02.47,0:21:08.23,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}あの時　教えてくれたね
Dialogue: 3,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.32,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}涙　流していいんだ
Dialogue: 3,0:21:21.91,0:21:26.37,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}ボロボロになってもいいの
Dialogue: 3,0:21:26.37,0:21:28.25,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}信じてる
Dialogue: 3,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.87,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}あきらめない力を
Dialogue: 3,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.46,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}抗える息吹きを
Dialogue: 3,0:21:33.46,0:21:38.97,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}僕らは　僕らの命は持ってるよ
Dialogue: 3,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.68,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}どこまでも続いてく
Dialogue: 3,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.39,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}何もかも抱きしめる
Dialogue: 3,0:21:44.39,0:21:46.77,ED_EP11_JP1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}だって　だって
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:23:16.29,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur20\c&H000000&\pos(0,960)\p1}m 0 0 l1920 0 l 1920 150 l 0 150
Dialogue: 3,0:21:47.43,0:21:52.48,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}あなたがいる　Ah Ah
Dialogue: 3,0:21:56.02,0:22:02.11,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}Shine a light on you
Dialogue: 3,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.44,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}目が覚め　目を開け　時を追う
Dialogue: 3,0:22:08.44,0:22:13.83,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}リビングの床まで陽が漏れる
Dialogue: 3,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.90,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}きりがないそういうとこだね
Dialogue: 3,0:22:17.90,0:22:23.15,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}途中で　引き返したりして
Dialogue: 3,0:22:23.15,0:22:28.36,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}そんなに　上手にやれない
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.00,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}それでも
Dialogue: 3,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.95,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}言わなくたっていいんだ
Dialogue: 3,0:22:45.58,0:22:50.01,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}溺れそうになったとしても
Dialogue: 3,0:22:50.01,0:22:51.76,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}大丈夫
Dialogue: 3,0:22:51.76,0:22:54.34,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}報われない昨日が
Dialogue: 3,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.06,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}逆らえない弱さが
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.06,0:23:02.53,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}僕らを　僕らの痛みを知ってるさ
Dialogue: 3,0:23:02.53,0:23:05.19,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}ゆるやかな傾斜で
Dialogue: 3,0:23:05.19,0:23:07.81,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}行くあてない速度で
Dialogue: 3,0:23:07.81,0:23:15.96,ED_EP11_JP2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}そっと　そっと　変わってくから Ah Ah
Dialogue: 2,0:20:42.20,0:20:46.75,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}哪怕是那  憂心忡忡的不安夜
Dialogue: 2,0:20:47.62,0:20:52.67,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}但只要為  心靈點上一盞燈火
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.00,0:20:57.01,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}雖然渺茫  但希望卻永不熄滅
Dialogue: 2,0:20:57.01,0:21:02.14,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}低聲細語  你就這般告訴了我
Dialogue: 2,0:21:02.47,0:21:08.23,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}在那一刻  你就這般告訴了我
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.32,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}即便流淚  又有什麼關係
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.91,0:21:26.37,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}即便殘缺  又有什麼關係
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.37,0:21:28.25,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}只要相信
Dialogue: 2,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.87,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}相信永不放棄的力量
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.87,0:21:33.46,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}相信抗爭到底的勇氣
Dialogue: 2,0:21:33.46,0:21:38.97,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}我們的命  終究把握在我們自己的手心
Dialogue: 2,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.68,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}不論走到天涯或海角
Dialogue: 2,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.39,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}不論什麼都擁之入懷
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.39,0:21:46.77,ED_EP11_TC1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}因為  因為
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.25,0:23:16.29,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur20\c&H000000&\pos(0,-30)\p1}m 0 0 l1920 0 l 1920 150 l 0 150
Dialogue: 2,0:21:47.43,0:21:52.48,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}有你在我身邊  Ah Ah
Dialogue: 2,0:21:56.02,0:22:02.11,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}Shine a light on you
Dialogue: 2,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.44,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}退出夢境  睜開了眼追逐時間
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.44,0:22:13.83,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}在客廳裡  地板撒上幾縷陽光
Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.83,0:22:17.90,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}雖然無盡  可是事實就是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:22:17.90,0:22:23.15,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}在路途上  要我回頭走到原點
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.15,0:22:28.36,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}可是我啊  我沒辦法那麼乾脆
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.00,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}即便如此
Dialogue: 2,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.95,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}即便不說  又有什麼關係
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.58,0:22:50.01,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}即便沉溺  又有什麼關係
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.01,0:22:51.76,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}沒有問題
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.76,0:22:54.34,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}那些沒有回報的昨天
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.06,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}那些無法抗拒的軟弱
Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.06,0:23:02.53,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}明白我們  明白我們內心的種種傷痛啊
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.53,0:23:05.19,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}哪怕路途上有些傾斜
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.19,0:23:07.81,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}哪怕因迷茫龜速前進
Dialogue: 2,0:23:07.81,0:23:15.96,ED_EP11_TC2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3}悄地  悄地  一點點在改變  Ah Ah
